2.3 Distance Metrics

FAISS supports L2 (Euclidean), Inner Product (IP/cosine after normalization), and limited support for L1 and L∞. For our use cases — embedding-based similarity — L2 and IP are the primary metrics. Cosine similarity is achieved by normalizing vectors to unit length and using IP.

